r><strong>Relaxing atmosphere:</strong> Beautiful slow music and vibrant minimalistic visuals help you relax, forget about everything, and focus on the logic in all its beauty.<br><br><strong>Extensive hints:</strong> Every puzzle has an extensive series of hints, which allows every player to tackle even the most difficult puzzles and experience all the elegant logic to the fullest extent.<br><br><strong>Steam Workshop:</strong> Make your own 3D sudoku puzzles in an easy-to-use sudoku editor (with a solver!) and share them via Steam Workshop. Or play top-rated puzzles from the Workshop.<br><br><strong>Accesibility:</strong> The game is colorblind and hearing impaired friendly; playable with mouse only or mouse + keyboard combination; and does not require any time-sensitive or simultaneous inputs.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051910/extras/f147f4bc80ac129391125e7a44250470.poster.avif?t=1748118071\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051910/extras/f147f4bc80ac129391125e7a44250470.webm?t=1748118071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051910/extras/f147f4bc80ac129391125e7a44250470.mp4?t=1748118071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>",
